  | ok wide read 10 C r
  | ok wide read 10 C rb
  | ok wide read 10 C rt
  | ok wide read 10 C r, ccs=UTF-8
  | ok wide read 10 C r, ccs=UTF-16LE
  | ok wide read 10 C r, ccs=UNICODE
