  | ok wide read 10 .UTF8 r, ccs=UNICODE
  | ok wide read sample 11
  | ok wide read 11 C r
  | ok wide read 11 C rb
  | ok wide read 11 C rt
  | ok wide read 11 C r, ccs=UTF-8
  | ok wide read 11 C r, ccs=UTF-16LE
  | ok wide read 11 C r, ccs=UNICODE
  | ok wide read 11 .UTF8 r
  | ok wide read 11 .UTF8 rb
  | ok wide read 11 .UTF8 rt
  | ok wide read 11 .UTF8 r, ccs=UTF-8
  | ok wide read 11 .UTF8 r, ccs=UTF-16LE
  | ok wide read 11 .UTF8 r, ccs=UNICODE
  | ok wide read real removed
  | ok wide read reset removed
  | done 0
  | [Heap] Allocs: <NUM>, Frees: <NUM>, Leaked: 0
